  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The azo-dye <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>Y</mi></mfenced></math> formed in the following reactions is Sulphanilic acid <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mo> </mo><msub><mi>NaNO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>COOH</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/83aeb67f-9340-4d45-8873-3438114331eb.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 156px;\"/></p>",
